[{"answer":"Ah, Michelle. I thought I'd find you here.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-8-2023-01-27-20-32-59/1.mp3"},{"answer":"Hello, Henry.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-8-2023-01-27-20-32-59/2.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, I'm afraid the smoker's lounge is about the only place I can relax in around here.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-8-2023-01-27-20-32-59/3.mp3"},{"answer":"Can I do something for you, or are you just slumming?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-8-2023-01-27-20-32-59/4.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, I was wondering...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-8-2023-01-27-20-32-59/5.mp3"},{"answer":"You teach the afternoon section of Modern Social Systems, don't you?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-8-2023-01-27-20-32-59/6.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, that's me. Why?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-8-2023-01-27-20-32-59/7.mp3"},{"answer":"Have you got a student in there by the name of Steiger, Sara Steiger?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-8-2023-01-27-20-32-59/8.mp3"},{"answer":"Sara? Yes, you know her?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-8-2023-01-27-20-32-59/9.mp3"},{"answer":"I sure do.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-8-2023-01-27-20-32-59/10.mp3"},{"answer":"She's in my undergrad psychology seminar.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-8-2023-01-27-20-32-59/11.mp3"},{"answer":"She's beginning to be a real problem for the class,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-8-2023-01-27-20-32-59/12.mp3"},{"answer":"and I was just wondering how you were handling her.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-8-2023-01-27-20-32-59/13.mp3"},{"answer":"Or is she OK in your class?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-8-2023-01-27-20-32-59/14.mp3"},{"answer":"OK? Uh... Yes.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-8-2023-01-27-20-32-59/15.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, not really,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-8-2023-01-27-20-32-59/16.mp3"},{"answer":"but she's just eager to learn, I think, don't you?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-8-2023-01-27-20-32-59/17.mp3"},{"answer":"You think so?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-8-2023-01-27-20-32-59/18.mp3"},{"answer":"That's why she never stops asking questions?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-8-2023-01-27-20-32-59/19.mp3"},{"answer":"I'll tell you what I think,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-8-2023-01-27-20-32-59/20.mp3"},{"answer":"I think she already knows the answers before she asks.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-8-2023-01-27-20-32-59/21.mp3"},{"answer":"Or she's just asking for the sake of asking.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-8-2023-01-27-20-32-59/22.mp3"},{"answer":"Huh? Why's that?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-8-2023-01-27-20-32-59/23.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, half the time she wants to know about something we've already discussed in some detail,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-8-2023-01-27-20-32-59/24.mp3"},{"answer":"and half the time she has questions that are off-topic or, well, just, uh, mindless.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-8-2023-01-27-20-32-59/25.mp3"},{"answer":"I suppose you could be right about that.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-8-2023-01-27-20-32-59/26.mp3"},{"answer":"Sara can certainly be irritating sometimes.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-8-2023-01-27-20-32-59/27.mp3"},{"answer":"Sometimes I feel I'm cheating the rest of the students by spending so much time explaining things to her.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-8-2023-01-27-20-32-59/28.mp3"},{"answer":"Exactly. And I can see them all rolling their eyes.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-8-2023-01-27-20-32-59/29.mp3"},{"answer":"The rest of my class is a little irritated with her, too.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-8-2023-01-27-20-32-59/30.mp3"},{"answer":"Maybe we should just give her the benefit of the doubt.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-8-2023-01-27-20-32-59/31.mp3"},{"answer":"Maybe she's just trying too hard, I dunno, to learn maybe,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-8-2023-01-27-20-32-59/32.mp3"},{"answer":"or maybe just to make an impression on us.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-8-2023-01-27-20-32-59/33.mp3"},{"answer":"I don't know what her motives could be.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-8-2023-01-27-20-32-59/34.mp3"},{"answer":"Yeah, well. She's making an impression, all right, but it isn't a good one.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-8-2023-01-27-20-32-59/35.mp3"},{"answer":"Any ideas?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-8-2023-01-27-20-32-59/36.mp3"},{"answer":"Pro-active ones, I mean.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-8-2023-01-27-20-32-59/37.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, I guess we should have a talk with her.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-8-2023-01-27-20-32-59/38.mp3"},{"answer":"A talk? A private one, you mean?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-8-2023-01-27-20-32-59/39.mp3"},{"answer":"Yeah. It's either that, or just give her the cold shoulder.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-8-2023-01-27-20-32-59/40.mp3"},{"answer":"I'm afraid I've already been giving her a bit of that.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-8-2023-01-27-20-32-59/41.mp3"},{"answer":"I thought maybe she'd take the hint and sit back, listen and take notes for a change.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-8-2023-01-27-20-32-59/42.mp3"},{"answer":"She doesn't, doesn't take any notes?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-8-2023-01-27-20-32-59/43.mp3"},{"answer":"She does in my class, voluminous ones!","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-8-2023-01-27-20-32-59/44.mp3"},{"answer":"Are you sure, Michelle?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-8-2023-01-27-20-32-59/45.mp3"},{"answer":"Sure, I'm sure, she's always scribbling away.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-8-2023-01-27-20-32-59/46.mp3"},{"answer":"But have you seen Sara's notes?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-8-2023-01-27-20-32-59/47.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, no, but...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-8-2023-01-27-20-32-59/48.mp3"},{"answer":"I have. I took a peek over her shoulder a couple of times.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-8-2023-01-27-20-32-59/49.mp3"},{"answer":"She's a doodler.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-8-2023-01-27-20-32-59/50.mp3"},{"answer":"A what?! She doodles?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-8-2023-01-27-20-32-59/51.mp3"},{"answer":"All over her notebook.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-8-2023-01-27-20-32-59/52.mp3"},{"answer":"I don't think she's keeping any kind of notes or paying attention at all to what I'm saying or what anyone else says in class.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-8-2023-01-27-20-32-59/53.mp3"},{"answer":"She's just daydreaming, or dreaming up something irrelevant to inquire into.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-8-2023-01-27-20-32-59/54.mp3"},{"answer":"This morning we'd been talking about Jung's theory of archetypes,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-8-2023-01-27-20-32-59/55.mp3"},{"answer":"and she suddenly blurted out \"What's an archtype?\"","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-8-2023-01-27-20-32-59/56.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, we'd been discussing archtypes for half an hour by then,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-8-2023-01-27-20-32-59/57.mp3"},{"answer":"and it was like she'd just realized she'd heard a strange word,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-8-2023-01-27-20-32-59/58.mp3"},{"answer":"when the conversation was almost over.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-8-2023-01-27-20-32-59/59.mp3"},{"answer":"Heh! That's Sara, all right.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-8-2023-01-27-20-32-59/60.mp3"},{"answer":"OK then, who's going to talk to her, you or me?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-8-2023-01-27-20-32-59/61.mp3"},{"answer":"Umm..","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-8-2023-01-27-20-32-59/62.mp3"},{"answer":"OK, OK, I'll see if I can get her to come in and talk to me later this week.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-8-2023-01-27-20-32-59/63.mp3"},{"answer":"I'll be seeing her in class tomorrow afternoon, I guess.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-8-2023-01-27-20-32-59/64.mp3"},{"answer":"Maybe I can get her to settle down a little...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-8-2023-01-27-20-32-59/65.mp3"},{"answer":"She doodles?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-8-2023-01-27-20-32-59/66.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes! Pretty good, really.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-8-2023-01-27-20-32-59/67.mp3"},{"answer":"Complex, architectural, rococo things.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-8-2023-01-27-20-32-59/68.mp3"},{"answer":"Maybe she could go to art school instead of majoring in sociology.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-8-2023-01-27-20-32-59/69.mp3"},{"answer":"That's Sara's major, is it?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-8-2023-01-27-20-32-59/70.mp3"},{"answer":"I think so, I think she mentioned that once.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-8-2023-01-27-20-32-59/71.mp3"},{"answer":"Anyway, yes, if you could have a little talk with her, that would be great.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-8-2023-01-27-20-32-59/72.mp3"},{"answer":"And let me know what happens, what you find out, will you?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-8-2023-01-27-20-32-59/73.mp3"},{"answer":"Of course. I'll let you know how it goes.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-8-2023-01-27-20-32-59/74.mp3"},{"answer":"Thanks, Michelle, very much. I owe you one.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-8-2023-01-27-20-32-59/75.mp3"},{"answer":"Now, I've got to run before all this secondhand smoke does me in.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-8-2023-01-27-20-32-59/76.mp3"},{"answer":"Haha... Now don't start that!","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-8-2023-01-27-20-32-59/77.mp3"},{"answer":"Haha, all right, but you know you should really try to,-","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-8-2023-01-27-20-32-59/78.mp3"},{"answer":"Henry!","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-8-2023-01-27-20-32-59/79.mp3"},{"answer":"OK. Thanks. See you.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-8-2023-01-27-20-32-59/80.mp3"},{"answer":"Talk to you soon.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-8-2023-01-27-20-32-59/81.mp3"}]
